00:49:05.430 --> 00:49:09.310
cultures followed you through your
new school and Edgbaston High.

00:49:09.310 --> 00:49:12.590
I tried to be part of a lot of fun
when I was at McKinsey as well.

00:49:12.590 --> 00:49:18.160
I thought was a natural fit, but I come
from a family of strong feminists and

00:49:18.160 --> 00:49:20.823
I've benefited from that as well.

00:49:20.823 --> 00:49:27.630
But I have seen a massive conflict in
tradition versus progression and culture.

