&gt;&gt; [LAUGH]
&gt;&gt; When I started living in the UK there

00:49:57.972 --> 00:50:04.887
were so many things that surprised us we
were living in cold weather forever and

00:50:04.887 --> 00:50:11.382
we were missing our nice warm summer
days in Pakistan but other than that,

00:50:11.382 --> 00:50:18.220
I started studying in a school where
we were getting quality education.

00:50:18.220 --> 00:50:23.632
That was the first time when I realized
that education is not just about sciences

00:50:23.632 --> 00:50:29.045
and maths and learning English, but
students also learn cooking and sports and

00:50:29.045 --> 00:50:34.660
textiles and these are not the subjects
that you often see in schools in Pakistan.

00:50:34.660 --> 00:50:39.742
And it really challenges you to
think about education in different

00:50:39.742 --> 00:50:45.201
ways in which the goal is not to make
somebody a doctor or engineer only.

00:50:45.201 --> 00:50:49.487
But to ensure that anyone
can go to that institution,

00:50:49.487 --> 00:50:55.965
they can explore their their abilities and
they can explore their specialties,

00:50:55.965 --> 00:50:59.978
and then realize and
reach their full potential.

00:50:59.978 --> 00:51:05.646
So, when I was studying in
the UK I realized that education

00:51:05.646 --> 00:51:11.674
is not just limited to sciences and
maths and those subjects.

00:51:11.674 --> 00:51:19.259
But then also along with that there's a
good health system and you are much safer.

00:51:19.259 --> 00:51:26.741
But your home is your home and
you miss so many things about your home.

00:51:26.741 --> 00:51:31.133
When you are with your friends and
family and

00:51:31.133 --> 00:51:38.136
you are sitting in your sort of dining
room with your family friends and

00:51:38.136 --> 00:51:43.240
you are enjoying nice food and
you are surrounded by

00:51:43.240 --> 00:51:48.240
this beautiful valley in
these lush green hills.

00:51:48.240 --> 00:51:52.530
You're happy and
you're still having like a joyful time.

00:51:52.530 --> 00:51:55.730
So, I think for
us even though we were having

00:51:55.730 --> 00:52:00.416
all those facilities we would
still miss Pakistan all the time.

00:52:00.416 --> 00:52:05.319
And I have seen this in many
places people consider the west

00:52:05.319 --> 00:52:10.322
to be sort of the standard of
prosperity and development and

00:52:10.322 --> 00:52:14.240
I think we need to sort
of challenge that a bit.

00:52:15.630 --> 00:52:20.085
Because the pandemic and the recent events
have exposed how the systems in many

00:52:20.085 --> 00:52:22.260
countries are not the ideal systems.

00:52:22.260 --> 00:52:26.604
They are still not favoring the most
marginalized people in society,

00:52:26.604 --> 00:52:31.318
they are discriminating against people
based on their income background,

00:52:31.318 --> 00:52:35.100
based on their skin color,
based on their gender.

00:52:35.100 --> 00:52:39.553
So, we need to be a bit more critical
of the system that we idolize and

00:52:39.553 --> 00:52:44.569
it's possible for Pakistan and
other countries to improve their systems.

00:52:44.569 --> 00:52:50.389
And this is a challenge for countries all
over the world to improve their systems,

00:52:50.389 --> 00:52:55.533
to ensure that they provide welfare
to all its citizens and it's based on

00:52:55.533 --> 00:53:01.130
adjust an equal system, so nobody is
left out and nobody is treated unfairly.

